Plasma Visual Screensaver source package
========================================

This is a non-native 3.0 (quilt) package. The upstream orig tarball must be
generated from the matching signed-off Git tag while excluding the debian
directory. The upstream Git repository's scripts/build-ppa-source.sh performs
that export, overlays the current Debian packaging, builds the source package,
and runs source linting.

The PPA version has the form UPSTREAM-REVISIONppaN~resoluteN. It deliberately
sorts later than the matching GitHub binary package so a user can migrate from
the standalone .deb to the PPA without a downgrade.
